# Gooo semantic authority census policy v1.
policy semantic-authority-census-v1
precedence REFUTED UNKNOWN CLOSED
unknown_fields stage step reason unknown_class next_operation blocked_by
cell LOAD_POLICY FOUNDATION DRIVER LoadAuthorityPolicy
cell BIND_SOURCE FOUNDATION DRIVER BindGoooSource
cell BIND_SEMANTIC_IR FOUNDATION DRIVER BindSemanticIR
cell BIND_GENERATED_GO FOUNDATION OUTCOME BindGeneratedGo
cell VERIFY_SOURCE_IR COHERENCE OUTCOME VerifySourceIRSemantics
cell VERIFY_IR_GENERATED COHERENCE OUTCOME VerifyIRGeneratedSemantics
cell CLASSIFY_IMPLEMENTATION_AUTHORITY COHERENCE GUARDRAIL ClassifyImplementationAuthority
cell VERIFY_INPUT_FRESHNESS COHERENCE DRIVER VerifyInputFreshness
cell PRESERVE_UNKNOWN_FRONTIER REGRESSION GUARDRAIL PreserveUnknownFrontier
cell PRESERVE_REFUTATION REGRESSION GUARDRAIL PreserveRefutingCounterexample
cell VERIFY_DETERMINISTIC_REPLAY REGRESSION GUARDRAIL VerifyDeterministicReplay
cell PUBLISH_HUMAN_REPORT REGRESSION OUTCOME PublishHumanReadableReport
